          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "'s people have denied him and have said, “He won't really do anything.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5.12",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "He won't",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "…",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "anything",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "; or",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "We don't want anything to do with him.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " We won't have hard times; we won't have war or famine.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They have said that the prophets are nothing but windbags and that they have no message from the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.13+JER.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.13",
              "JER.5.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.13+JER.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.13",
              "JER.5.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " God Almighty said to me, “Jeremiah, because these people have said such things, I will make my words like a fire in your mouth. The people will be like wood, and the fire will burn them up.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.13+JER.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.13",
              "JER.5.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.13+JER.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.13",
              "JER.5.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 5:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "People of Israel, the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " is bringing a nation from afar to attack you. It is a strong and ancient nation, a nation whose language you do not know. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 5:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Their bowmen are mighty soldiers who kill without mercy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 5:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They will devour your crops and your food; they will kill your sons and your daughters. They will slaughter your flocks and your herds and destroy your vines and fig trees. The fortified cities in which you trust will be destroyed by their army.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 5:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 5:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " says, “Yet even in those days I will not completely destroy my people. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 5:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When they ask why I did all these things, tell them, Jeremiah, that just as they turned away from me and served foreign gods in their own land, so they will serve strangers in a land that is not theirs.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 5:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 5:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " says, “Tell the descendants of Jacob, tell the people of Judah: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 5:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.6.9+ISA.6.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Is 6.9–10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.12.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezek 12.2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MRK.8.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mk 8.18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pay attention, you foolish and stupid people, who have eyes, but cannot see, and have ears, but cannot hear. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 5:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOB.38.8+JOB.38.9+JOB.38.10+JOB.38.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Job 38.8–11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I am the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "; why don't you fear me? Why don't you tremble before me? I placed the sand as the boundary of the sea, a permanent boundary that it cannot cross. The sea may toss, but it cannot go beyond it; the waves may roar, but they cannot break through. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 5:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But you people! You are stubborn and rebellious; you have turned aside and left me. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 5:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You never thought to honour me, even though I send the autumn rains and the spring rains and give you the harvest season each year. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 5:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Instead, your sins have kept these good things from you.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 5:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 5:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Evildoers live among my people; they lie in wait like those who spread nets to catch birds,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5.26",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Probable text",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "they",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "…",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "birds",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "; Hebrew unclear.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " but they have set their traps to catch people. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 5:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Just as a hunter fills a cage with birds, they have filled their houses with loot. That is why they are powerful and rich, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 5:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "why they are fat and well fed. There is no limit to their evil deeds. They do not give orphans their rights or show justice to the oppressed.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 5:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 5:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“But I, the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", will punish them for these things; I will take revenge on this nation. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 5:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A terrible and shocking thing has happened in the land: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 5:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "prophets speak nothing but lies; priests rule as the prophets command, and my people offer no objections. But what will they do when it all comes to an end?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
